    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d708">

                <pb facs="0813" n="728" sameAs="frus:frus1919v02/pg728"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">823.00/253: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Consul General at Callao-Lima</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Handley</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-07-12T16:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 12,
                                1919</hi>, [<hi rendition="#italic">4
                    p.m.</hi>]</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Your July 4, 3 p.m.<anchor n="4" xml:id="d708-f1"/></p>
                <p>Department at a loss to understand how your private interview with Leguia came
                    about. Did you call upon him? You are instructed to ascertain from American
                    Minister the attitude of this Government toward recent events in Peru and be
                    governed accordingly.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
